# Who wrote the code in CSherpaOnnx, and what its notice must contain for each: scripts/engines/check-notice.py fails
# unless every group of the library's symbols is claimed by a line here, and every claiming line's license files are in
# the notice word for word.
#
# Tab-separated columns:
#   1. the library;
#   2. its groups of symbols, a regular expression for the whole group name: a C++ symbol's outermost namespace or class
#      (or the function, in the global namespace; for google, which protobuf shares with glog and gflags, the first two:
#      "google::protobuf"), "C " and a C symbol's prefix (up to its first underscore), "ObjC " and a class, or
#      "(operator) " and the symbol, for an operator outside any namespace;
#   3. its license files, space-separated, which the notice must contain word for word ("-": none needed);
#   4. a line its section of that file has, when the file covers several libraries ("-": the whole file is its own).
sherpa-onnx	sherpa_onnx|SherpaOnnx\w*|GetByteBpeTable\w*|C SherpaOnnx\w*|C SherpaOffline\w*	LICENSE	-
kaldi-native-fbank	knf	kaldi-native-fbank-LICENSE	-
kaldi-decoder	kaldi_decoder	kaldi-decoder-LICENSE	-
kaldifst	kaldifst	kaldifst-LICENSE	-
OpenFst	fst|FlagRegister|FlagRegisterer|LogMessage|FailedNewHandler|ShowUsage|SetFlags|FstCheck|C FST	openfst-COPYING LICENSE	-
simple-sentencepiece	ssentencepiece	simple-sentencepiece-LICENSE	-
darts-clone (in simple-sentencepiece)	Darts	darts-clone-COPYING.md	-
ThreadPool (in simple-sentencepiece)	ThreadPool	threadpool-COPYING	-
KISS FFT (in kaldi-native-fbank)	C kiss|C kfc	kissfft-COPYING kissfft-BSD-3-Clause	-
hclust-cpp with fastcluster	fastclustercpp	hclust-cpp-LICENSE	-
utf8proc	C utf8proc	utf8proc-LICENSE.md	-
nlohmann/json	nlohmann	json-LICENSE.MIT	-
Eigen	Eigen	eigen-COPYING.MPL2	-
ONNX Runtime	onnxruntime|onnx_transpose_optimization|model_package|ModelPackage|c_api_internal|nhwc_map_internal|Ort\w*|ToScalarTensor|ToTensorInitialize|MLDataTypeToOnnxRuntimeTensorElementDataType|AddTensorRTCustomOpDomainToSessionOption|CreateSessionAndLoadModel|InitializeSession|CopyStringToOutputArg|SafeMultiply|\(operator\) \w*Ort\w*|C Ort\w*|C ModelPackage\w*|C ModelComponentInfo|C ModelVariantInfo|C SetOrClearString|C ReparseVariantInPlace|C MutateExecutorInfo|C AddFinding|C g_is_shutting_down	onnxruntime/LICENSE	-
MLAS (in ONNX Runtime)	Mlas\w*|MLAS_\w*|BlockwiseQuantizer|BlockwiseQDQQuantizer|Q80BlkQuant|SQ[248]BitGemm\w*|Q4BitBlkDequant\w*|QuantizeARow_\w*|PackQuantBData_\w*|PackScalesAndZeroPoints_\w*|GenerateLUT_\w*|TMACComputeGemm_\w*|lut_ctor_\w*|tbl_g4_\w*|partial_max_g4_\w*|load_float_n_\w*|HGemmOperation|CalculateLutBufferSize|ThreadedBuf\w*|GetMlas\w*|rope_avx2|sqnbitgemm_neon|C Mlas\w*|C CheckSaturationForVPMADDUBSW	onnxruntime/LICENSE	-
MurmurHash3 (in ONNX Runtime)	getblock	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	MurmurHash3
ONNX (in ONNX Runtime)	onnx	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	Copyright (c) Facebook, Inc. and Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.
protobuf (in ONNX Runtime)	google::protobuf	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	Copyright 2008 Google Inc.
abseil (in ONNX Runtime)	absl|C Absl\w*	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	https://github.com/abseil/abseil-cpp
re2 (in ONNX Runtime)	re2	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	Copyright (c) 2009 The RE2 Authors. All rights reserved.
flatbuffers (in ONNX Runtime)	flatbuffers	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	google/flatbuffers
SafeInt (in ONNX Runtime)	SafeInt|SafeIntExceptionHandler	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	dcleblanc/SafeInt
GSL (in ONNX Runtime)	gsl	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	Microsoft GSL
date (in ONNX Runtime)	date	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	HowardHinnant/date
Boost (in ONNX Runtime)	boost	onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt	Boost Software License - Version 1.0 - August 17th, 2003
